# EXAMPLE ONLY: copy to .github/CODEOWNERS after replacing real accounts.
# USER_* are placeholders and have NO effect. Teams/users must have repository write access.
# Last matching rule takes precedence. Multiple owners on one line means any one may satisfy review.
* @USER_INTEGRATION
/Source/TribeGame/Inventory/ @USER_INVENTORY
/Source/TribeGame/Companion/ @USER_COMPANION
/Source/TribeGame/Save/ @USER_SAVE
/Source/TribeGame/UI/ @USER_UI
/Content/Tribe/World/ @USER_WORLD
/docs/design/ @USER_DESIGN
/docs/decisions/ @USER_DESIGN @USER_TECHNICAL
/docs/contracts/ @USER_TECHNICAL
/Source/TribeGame/Contracts/ @USER_TECHNICAL
/Config/ @USER_TECHNICAL
/*.uproject @USER_TECHNICAL
/config/ @USER_TECHNICAL
/.gitattributes @USER_INTEGRATION
/.gitignore @USER_INTEGRATION
/AGENTS.md @USER_INTEGRATION
/CLAUDE.md @USER_INTEGRATION
/WORKFLOW.md @USER_INTEGRATION
/scripts/ @USER_INTEGRATION
/.github/ @USER_INTEGRATION
/.github/CODEOWNERS @USER_INTEGRATION
